  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nin `homeserver.yaml`, when `public_baseurl:` is configured to `http://<homeserver>` and there are only `tls: true` listeners, many clients throw misleading errors:\r\n\r\n    NETWORK_ERROR\r\n    net::ERR_EMPTY_RESPONSE\r\n\r\nAnd synapse does not report any errors. \r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- set `public_baseurl: \"http://<homeserver>:8448\"` in homeserver.yaml\r\n- set `listeners: [{port: 8448, bind_address: \"\", type: http, tls: true, x_forwarded: false, resour\r\nces: [{names: [\"client\",\"webclient\",\"federation\"], compress: false}]}] ` in homeserver.yaml\r\n\r\n- start the homeserver\r\n- log in with riot-desktop or riot-android. \r\n",
